{"id":"e1275c40f030ae92","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Entropy Rate","display":"df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate — ZFC Measure9 Entropy Rate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate — ZFC Measure9 Entropy Rate","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-entropy]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-entropy-rate — ZFC Measure9 Entropy Rate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc3b74121029112d\" href=\"?note=bc3b74121029112d\" title=\"58-df-entropy\">58-df-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"549cf65f429db76a\" href=\"?note=549cf65f429db76a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map\">58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\)</span> (measure-preserving probability system)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\)</span> (finite measurable partition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> (entropy-rate value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\\)</span> (measure-preserving predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"549cf65f429db76a\" href=\"?note=549cf65f429db76a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map\">58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9EntropyRate}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9EntropyRate}_S\\)</span> (operator defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}rate}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9EntropyRate}_S(h,T,\\mathcal P,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S(T,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal A,X,X)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal P)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal P\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal P=X\\land\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P\\;(P\\neq Q\\to P\\cap Q=\\varnothing)\\land h\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\bigl|h-\\tfrac1n H_\\mu(\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}T^{-i}\\mathcal P)\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}rate}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9EntropyRate}_S(h,T,\\mathcal P,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S(T,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal A,X,X)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal P)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal P\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal P=X\\land\\forall P,Q\\in\\mathcal P\\;(P\\neq Q\\to P\\cap Q=\\varnothing)\\land h\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\bigl|h-\\tfrac1n H_\\mu(\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}T^{-i}\\mathcal P)\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The blocks form a finite partition in the strict sense: they are measurable, pairwise disjoint, nonempty, and cover <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b74121029112d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数